# Third-party operator logos — REAL companies' trademarks, attached to invented
# ratings and prices. These stay out of every deployment regardless of the
# VITE_SHOW_DEMO flag; OperatorCard falls back to a monogram, which costs the
# mockup very little and keeps other people's marks off ICEFALL's servers.
public/img/operators

# NOTE: public/img/guides is deliberately NOT ignored. Those portraits are
# GAN-generated faces of people who do not exist, so an exposed file harms
# nobody, and they are needed to review the marketplace on a phone. They are
# still gitignored. See src/lib/demoFlag.ts for the protection requirement that
# governs the demo data they belong to.
